B.bsw=new A.cf(B.er,["General","Rent & Lease","When is rent due and what payment methods are accepted?","Rent is due on the 1st of each month. You can pay via the Tenant Portal (ACH / Card) or approved methods listed on your lease."],t.l)
B.bsp=new A.cf(B.er,["General","Emergency & Maintenance","What counts as an emergency maintenance request?","Active water leaks, no heat in winter, gas smells, fire hazards, or total power loss. Submit an urgent request with photos/video and call emergency dispatch."],t.l)
