B.bsx=new A.cf(B.er,["Unit","HVAC & Filters","What size HVAC air filter does this unit use?","16x25x1 MERV 8 pleated air filter in the hallway return grille. Replace every 90 days."],t.l)
B.bsn=new A.cf(B.er,["Unit","Shut-Off Valves","Where are the main water shut-off valve and breaker panel?","The main water shut-off valve is under the kitchen sink / utility closet. The circuit breaker panel is in the hallway closet."],t.l)
